package com.musetube.app.webview.injections

/*
 * YTM layout hack (rewritten from the Spotify sidebar/panel version).
 *
 * YTM has no Spotify-style sidebar panels, library overlay, nav-bar buttons
 * or track/album/artist links to intercept, so this keeps only the shells
 * other injections depend on:
 *  - window.closeNowPlay(): closes YTM's expanded fullscreen player when
 *    open (back navigation); otherwise a no-op. Driven by the CloseNowPlay
 *    pref like before.
 *  - window.clickNP(): opens the now-playing view for the current track
 *    (navigates to its watch URL).
 *  - window.addCSSJSHack(): installs a 5s watcher (kept for API parity;
 *    currently only re-applies the overlay stylesheet guard).
 *  - window.switchLs: removed (no YTM sidebar) — stubbed so legacy callers
 *    don't throw.
 * Plus the mobile viewport rules and the #musetubePlayerControls overlay
 * CSS. YTM's own player bar is hidden by the overlay init, not by CSS, so
 * original-player mode keeps working.
 */

